NOTE ON THE DATA, NOT THE CODE

This licence covers the source code in this repository only. It does not
cover the lightning data the program transports.

Lightning data is (c) Blitzortung.org contributors, licensed CC BY-SA 4.0,
and redistributed under the terms of https://lightningmaps.org/. The upstream
permits private, non-commercial, entertainment use only, and explicitly
prohibits use for storm warning systems, overvoltage plausibility checks and
risk analysis for protecting technology. Those restrictions apply to anything
you build on top of this bridge, whatever this file says about the code.

See the "Attribution and terms" section of README.md before you deploy this.